<BaseLayout
  title="Teaching Diffusion LLMs to Unmask Smarter | Catpuccino.ai"
  description="Apple Research replaces hand-crafted confidence heuristics with a 300K-param RL policy that learns adaptive token unmasking order — achieving ~50% accuracy at just 12 steps vs ≤30% for all heuristics in full-diffusion mode."
  crumb="RL dLLM Unmasking"
>

