  <h1>Teaching Diffusion LLMs to Unmask Smarter</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    Diffusion language models can generate tokens in parallel — but only if the sampler decides
    <em>which</em> tokens to unmask and <em>when</em>. Apple Research replaces hand-crafted
