<p>
  The length transfer result is particularly striking. As sequence length doubles (256→512),
  heuristics degrade further while the RL policy maintains its performance. The transformer
  architecture of the policy — which can process variable-length confidence vectors — is
  likely responsible for this robustness.
</p>
<p>
  Domain transfer to coding is more limited: policies trained purely on math data underperform
  Fast-dLLM on HumanEval. Training on a coding dataset (KodCode-RL-10K) narrows the gap,
  suggesting that diverse training data is more important for the policy than for the heuristic.
</p>

<!-- Listen-friendly content -->
<div class="listen-friendly-content" style="display: none;" aria-hidden="true">
  <div lang="en">
    <h2>Audio Summary: Teaching Diffusion LLMs to Unmask Smarter</h2>
    <p>Diffusion language models generate text by starting with a fully masked sequence and iteratively deciding which tokens to unmask at each step. The dominant approach uses confidence thresholding — unmask tokens the model is most confident about — but this heuristic collapses in full-diffusion mode, where the model must reason about all token positions simultaneously rather than working block by block.</p>
    <p>This paper from Apple Research proposes replacing the heuristic with a learned policy: a tiny 300,000-parameter transformer that takes token confidence scores as input and outputs unmasking decisions. The policy is trained from scratch via reinforcement learning using GRPO, with a multiplicative reward that only gives credit for fast generation when the answer is also correct. The result is a policy that achieves roughly 50 percent accuracy at just 12 sampling steps in full-diffusion mode — double what any heuristic achieves — and transfers across models and sequence lengths without retraining.</p>
  </div>
  <div lang="zh">
    <h2>语音摘要：让扩散语言模型学会更聪明的去掩码策略</h2>
    <p>扩散语言模型通过从完全掩码的序列开始、迭代决定哪些标记需要去掩码来生成文本。主流方法使用置信度阈值策略——优先去掩码模型最有把握的标记——但这种启发式方法在全扩散模式下会失效。在全扩散模式中，模型需要同时对所有标记位置进行推理，而不是逐块处理。</p>
    <p>苹果研究院的这篇论文提出用一个习得策略替代启发式规则：一个仅有30万参数的小型Transformer网络，以标记置信度分数为输入，输出去掩码决策。该策略通过GRPO强化学习从零开始训练，使用乘法奖励——只有在答案正确的情况下才给予快速生成的奖励。结果是一个在全扩散模式下仅需12个采样步骤就能达到约50%准确率的策略，是任何启发式方法的两倍，且无需重新训练即可跨模型和序列长度迁移。</p>
  </div>
</div>

